":"Naddiseo","id":115951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTk1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo","html_url":"https://github.com/Naddiseo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-31T17:45:43Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T17:45:43Z","body":"I did check the code in your repo... seems like your LLM led you astray.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/5482208599/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/5723518377","html_url":"https://github.com/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/109#issuecomment-5723518377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/109","id":5723518377,"node_id":"IC_kwDOD23F088AAAABVSX1qQ","user":{"login":"karim123e","id":330660393,"node_id":"U_kgDOE7V6KQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330660393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e","html_url":"https://github.com/karim123e","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karim123e/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T01:15:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T01:15:19Z","body":"الموضوع: Cosmic Duality — الخطوة الأخر\n\nمرحباً Naddiseo،\n\nأعمل على لغز GSMG منذ فترة، ووصلت إلى نقطة أقدّر فيها توضيحاً بسيطاً.\n\nلقد نجحت في:\n- فك تشفير Cosmic Duality (SHA-256 للمخرجات يطابق القيمة المعروفة)\n- استخراج المفتاحين الوسيطين (Half و Better Half)\n- التحقق من العناوين المقابلة لهما\n\nلكنني لا أستطيع استخراج المفتاح الخاص النهائي. جربت:\n- الجمع البسيط (mod n)\n- XOR\n- SHA-256 للتركيبات\n- عكس المفاتيح\n\nلا شيء من هذه ينتج العنوان المستهدف.\n\nلاحظت عملك على VanitySearch (منهجية المفتاح المقسم). فهمي أن \nالمفتاح النهائي يجب أن يكون k_part + k_secret (mod n)،\nحيث k_part يأتي من keyinfo.txt و k_secret هو أحد المفاتيح الوسيطة.\n\nسؤالي: هل keyinfo.txt موجود في مكان ما في بيانات اللغز،\nأم أن هناك خطوة مفقودة؟\n\nلا أطلب الإجابة — فقط تلميحاً توجيهياً، إذا كنت مستعداً لمشاركته.\n\nشكراً على وقتك.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/5723518377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/5903808733","html_url":"https://github.com/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/109#issuecomment-5903808733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/109","id":5903808733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOD23F088AAAABX-T43Q","user":{"login":"Naddiseo","id":115951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTk1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo","html_url":"https://github.com/Naddiseo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T04:04:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T04:04:13Z","body":"@karim123e getting claude to help translate\n\nEnglish:\n\nHi,\n\nThanks for reaching out. I think you've been led down a path that doesn't exist. A few things that should save you time:\n\nkeyinfo.txt isn't part of the puzzle. It's an output file from split-key vanity address generation, which is my tooling and unrelated to the puzzle's data. There's no missing step involving it.\nThe only two addresses that matter are 1GSMG1JC9wtdSwfwApgj2xcmJPAwx7prBe and 17ucy1K9ZUAaoY6JVtM932W9jUp5LXfyHa. Any other Bitcoin address you come across has nothing to do with the puzzle. Many were created by the community as distractions.\nBased on how the puzzle has gone so far, Cosmic Duality should decrypt to plain English text, not to key material. If your output is being validated against a hash or treated as a private key, something upstream has gone wrong.\n\nIf you've been working with an LLM on this, be careful. They tend to invent plausible-sounding intermediate steps (\"Half\", \"Better Half\", hash matches) that can't be verified. I'd go back to the primary puzzle data and check each claim yourself.\n\nGood luck!\n\nArabic (العربية):\n\nمرحباً،\n\nشكراً على تواصلك. أعتقد أنك سلكت مساراً غير موجود أصلاً، وهذه بعض النقاط التي قد توفر عليك الوقت:\n\nالملف keyinfo.txt ليس جزءاً من اللغز. إنه ملف ناتج عن توليد عناوين Vanity بالمفتاح المقسّم، وهو من أدواتي ولا علاقة له ببيانات اللغز. لا توجد خطوة مفقودة تتعلق به.\nالعنوانان الوحيدان المهمان هما 1GSMG1JC9wtdSwfwApgj2xcmJPAwx7prBe و 17ucy1K9ZUAaoY6JVtM932W9jUp5LXfyHa. أي عنوان بيتكوين آخر تصادفه لا علاقة له باللغز، وكثير منها أنشأه المجتمع كعناصر تشتيت.\nبحسب سير اللغز حتى الآن، يُفترض أن يُفك تشفير Cosmic Duality إلى نص إنجليزي عادي، وليس إلى مفاتيح. إذا كان ناتجك يُتحقق منه بمقارنة تجزئة أو يُعامل كمفتاح خاص، فهناك خطأ في خطوة سابقة.\n\nإذا كنت تستعين بنموذج ذكاء اصطناعي في هذا، فاحذر: هذه النماذج تخترع خطوات وسيطة تبدو مقنعة (\"Half\" و\"Better Half\" وتطابق التجزئة) ولا يمكن التحقق منها. أنصحك بالعودة إلى بيانات اللغز الأصلية والتحقق من كل ادعاء بنفسك.\n\nبالتوفيق!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/5903808733/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]